flowchart TD
    A[Urbanic Savana product module] --> B[Select Savana destination]
    B --> C{Configured navigation path}
    C -->|App launch| D{Arrival confirmed?}
    C -->|Marketplace| E[Marketplace / installation / manual open]
    D -->|Yes| F[Savana landing]
    D -->|Not confirmed| G[Retry / marketplace / return]
    G -->|Retry| B
    G -->|Marketplace| E
    E -. Context restoration depends on verified capability .-> F
    F --> H[Review authorization scope]
    H --> I{Authorize?}
    I -->|Cancel| J[Reauthorize / exit; browsing if supported]
    I -->|Confirm| K{Identity and account validation}
    K -->|Failure / conflict| L[Retry authorization / resolve account]
    K -->|Success| M[Establish Savana login]
    M --> N{Coupon eligibility}
    N -->|Not eligible / already received| O[Explain result; continue shopping]
    N -->|Eligible| P[Request coupon issuance; duplicate protection proposed]
    P --> Q{Issue result}
    Q -->|Success| R[Show coupon and terms]
    Q -->|Unknown / processing| S[Query unique issuance record]
    Q -->|Confirmed failure| T[Keep login; retry or recovery under agreed rules]
    S -->|Success| R
    S -->|Confirmed failure| T
    S -->|Still processing| U[Pending feedback and later lookup]
    R --> V[View coupon / continue shopping]
    O --> V
    V --> W[Applicable shopping offers; stacking requires confirmed rules]
